[{"key":"SCENARIO_s01_02020000_99_0000","text":"Motion"},{"key":"SCENARIO_s01_02020000_99_0010","text":"恋钟，便当带了吗？"},{"key":"SCENARIO_s01_02020000_99_0020","text":"今、今天没问题～！\n我不会再犯同样的错误了！！！"},{"key":"SCENARIO_s01_02020000_99_0030","text":"对不起……！"},{"key":"SCENARIO_s01_02020000_99_0040","text":"一想到会不会又像上次那样，就忍不住……"},{"key":"SCENARIO_s01_02020000_99_0011","text":"Motion"},{"key":"SCENARIO_s01_02020000_99_0050","text":"…………"},{"key":"SCENARIO_s01_02020000_99_0001","text":"Motion"},{"key":"SCENARIO_s01_02020000_99_0060","text":"咲耶～！下次大家一起吃饭哦！\n想吃什么都想好哦～！"},{"key":"SCENARIO_s01_02020000_99_0070","text":"嗯，我非常期待\n路上小心"},{"key":"SCENARIO_s01_02020000_99_0002","text":"Motion"},{"key":"SCENARIO_s01_02020000_99_0012","text":"Motion"},{"key":"SCENARIO_s01_02020000_99_0080","text":"小恋等等──啊，小咲耶！\n小恋已经走了吗？！"},{"key":"SCENARIO_s01_02020000_99_0090","text":"嗯──刚刚才走，\n应该还在楼梯下面吧"},{"key":"SCENARIO_s01_02020000_99_0100","text":"太好了！\n她又忘了带便当……！"},{"key":"SCENARIO_s01_02020000_99_0110","text":"──好，这次一定要赶上送给她\n然后三峰我就直接去排练了！"},{"key":"SCENARIO_s01_02020000_99_0013","text":"Motion"},{"key":"SCENARIO_s01_02020000_99_0120","text":"哈哈，路上小心\n希望你能有一堂愉快的排练"},{"key":"SCENARIO_s01_02020000_99_0130","text":"包在我身上！\n开心跳舞的成果会在全体练习时展示的！"},{"key":"SCENARIO_s01_02020000_99_0140","text":"呵呵……"},{"key":"SCENARIO_s01_02020000_99_0150","text":"忙是好事……"},{"key":"SCENARIO_s01_02020000_99_0003","text":"Motion"},{"key":"SCENARIO_s01_02020000_99_0014","text":"Motion"},{"key":"SCENARIO_s01_02020000_99_0160","text":"早上好……咲耶桑……"},{"key":"SCENARIO_s01_02020000_99_0170","text":"咦？\n咲耶，来得好早啊？"},{"key":"SCENARIO_s01_02020000_99_0005","text":"Motion"},{"key":"SCENARIO_s01_02020000_99_0180","text":"呀！摩美美、雾子\n呵呵，正因为来早了才能见到你们俩"},{"key":"SCENARIO_s01_02020000_99_0015","text":"Motion"},{"key":"SCENARIO_s01_02020000_99_0190","text":"……呵呵\n什么呀那是～"},{"key":"SCENARIO_s01_02020000_99_0200","text":"……呵呵"},{"key":"SCENARIO_s01_02020000_99_0004","text":"Motion"}]
